# Force LF for shell scripts regardless of the checking-out platform's git
# config. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true (a common
# default) converts docker-entrypoint.sh to CRLF on checkout. Docker COPYs
# that CRLF file straight into the nginx image as a docker-entrypoint.d/ hook;
# its "#!/bin/sh\r" shebang then fails to resolve inside the Linux container
# ("not found", exit 127) and nginx never starts.
*.sh text eol=lf
